# 🍳 Taylor's Recipe Helper

A simple React + Tailwind web app that helps busy professionals find recipes based on available ingredients using **TheMealDB API**.

### Features
- Search by ingredient
- View recipe cards
- Click to see ingredients & instructions
- Responsive clean design

### Tech Used
- React (Vite)
- Tailwind CSS
- Fetch API
- TheMealDB (no authentication needed)

### How to Run
1. Clone or open in CodeSandbox
2. `npm install`
3. `npm run dev`

### API Reference
- Search meals by ingredient: https://www.themealdb.com/api/json/v1/1/filter.php?i={ingredient}
- Get meal details: https://www.themealdb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i={mealId}
